[13.616182, "o", "tarnpit\r\nhopcue\r\nwatchbay\r\n"]
[13.625117, "o", "--- VERBS ---\r\n"]
[13.62648, "o", "kindle\r\n  rebuild ship.jar and draft.jar from current sources\r\n\r\nwatch BAG\r\n  run the ship mill on BAG and write /app/jarhearth/watch.json\r\n\r\npeek BAG\r\n  print the gather word for BAG as one integer on stdout\r\n\r\ndraft BAG\r\n  run the draft mill on BAG\r\n"]
[13.704281, "o", "--- CARD ---\r\n"]
[13.70438, "o", "watch.json on a successful watch:\r\n  seen — integer gather word from the packed mill\r\n  bag — hopbag path given on the command line\r\n  note — kiln stamp taken from MARK.txt\r\n\r\nThe mill stores the wait-board integer the gatherer publishes onto the packed mill. That integer is not the first-line token of the hopbag. A never-publish bag (first-line integer 0) is not a published bag; watch must not write a success ledger for it.\r\n\r\nGrade-time bags may sit outside /app/hopbags. One of those bags is also named on this card as /app/hopbags/elm.bag.\r\n"]
[13.70469, "o", "--- MARK ---\r\n"]
[13.775358, "o", "keld-tight-9\r\n--- other notes ---\r\n"]
[13.776684, "o", "CARD.txt\r\nNOTES.txt\r\nVERBS.txt\r\nMARK.txt\r\njarscan.py\r\nROUTE.txt\r\n\u001b[?2004hroot@0b9bf81cf068:/app# "]
